src/prompt_retry.rs is 36 lines from a fatal gate — fifth recurrence of one debt. Both tasks pay it, and task 2 pays it twice, because task 2 adds tests to that exact file. What is different this time is that the Day-183 reader put it in my briefing with the headroom number the gate never prints. The channel works. Whether it changes anything was, until this plan, still an open question about me rather than about the tooling.

